sequenceDiagram
  participant BIZ as 业务事务
  participant N as NotificationService
  participant DB as notification 表
  participant AC as AfterCommit
  participant WS as WebSocket
  participant UI as 消息中心
  BIZ->>N: create(dedupeKey)
  N->>DB: 单条 INSERT
  alt 唯一键冲突
    DB-->>N: DuplicateKey
    N-->>BIZ: created=false（不推送）
  else 首次插入
    DB-->>N: id
    N->>AC: register afterCommit
    BIZ-->>AC: COMMIT
    AC->>WS: NOTIFICATION（尽力投递）
    AC->>UI: 刷新角标
  end
  Note over DB,UI: 离线/推送失败时，登录后从收件箱查询；WS 不重放
